# Runtime data (compose.yaml's own bind-mount source) — never part of the build context. Besides
# being pointlessly huge (the manga library itself), a rootless-podman uid-mapped subdirectory
# under here (data/database/appendonlydir, owned by Redis's in-container uid) isn't even readable
# by the host user building the image, which fails the build outright without this exclusion.
data/
